# ggen-pack-spec-pack ontology — minimal admission scaffold (ticket T02).
#
# T01 (branch gpack/mkt-01-specpack-scaffold) owns the full gp: vocabulary
# (classes, profiles, renderers, ceilings, lifecycle, refusal codes) and the
# admission gates; its ontology.ttl is a semantic superset of this file and
# supersedes it at merge. This file self-describes the pack exactly as T01's
# ticket pins the self-description, so nothing asserted here is lost by
# taking T01's version. Marketplace admission requires at least one
# top-level ontology.ttl, hence this file ships with the T02 corpus.

@prefix gp: <https://ggen.dev/ns/pack#> .

<urn:ggen:pack:ggen-pack-spec-pack>
    a gp:Pack ;
    gp:name "ggen-pack-spec-pack" ;
    gp:version "0.1.0" ;
    gp:profile gp:Portable1 ;
    gp:authorityCeiling gp:Construct ;
    gp:lifecycle gp:Candidate .
